To make a post, create a new file with the following content:


---
layout: post
author: The PyConUK team
title: <The title of this awesome post>
---

{% assign links = site.data.links.md.short %}

<Say what you want to say here.>

<You can use links as {{links.linkedin}} or similar.>

<You can also {%include pyconuk_email.md%} or {%include sponsorship_email.md%}, for example.>
